body:prose = >`
  &ND v2

  # Appendix Guide and Authority [# appendix-guide-and-authority]

  Appendices are supporting documents for the consolidated AEON v1 spec set.

  Authority rule:

  - Canonical rules live in the top-level v1 specs and companion references.
  - Appendices are informative unless a canonical document explicitly delegates a topic to an appendix.
  - If an appendix conflicts with a canonical v1 document, the canonical v1 document wins.

  See:

  - AEON v1 Supersession and Precedence Table
  - AEON Specification v1
  - AEON Core v1 Compliance Specification
  - AEOS Specification v1

  Parser and grammar aids:

  - Appendix — Grammar Flow Cards — context-card illustrations for legal Core v1 parser flow.

  Evolution and forward-compatibility aids:

  - Appendix — Directive Block Capabilities — informative v1 reservation for directive-block capability declarations and future v2 activation.
`
